{
 "server": "notion-auto",
 "glossary": "Notion. One command per line: <verb> <noun> [id] [key=value]. Word order is free; plurals are fine. 'data source', 'source' and 'datasource' all work; db = database.\nIds are bare Notion UUIDs. Object keys take JSON with no spaces, e.g. parent={\"page_id\":\"..\"}. Array keys MUST be single-quoted: children='[{..}]' text='[..]' title='[..]' sorts='[..]'.\n  page      get <page_id> [filter_properties=] | read <page_id> (as markdown) [include_transcript=true] | create parent={\"page_id\":..} or {\"database_id\":..} properties={..} [children='[..]'] [icon=] [cover=] | update <page_id> [properties={..}] [icon={\"emoji\":..}] [cover=] [in_trash=] | delete/restore <page_id> (trash) | move <page_id> parent={\"type\":\"page_id\",\"page_id\":..} or {\"type\":\"workspace\"}\n  page markdown  write <page_id> content={\"new_str\":\"..\"} (replace all) | edit <page_id> edits={\"content_updates\":[{\"old_str\":..,\"new_str\":..}]} | update page markdown <page_id> type=replace_content|update_content|insert_content|replace_content_range\n  page property  get <page_id> <property_id> [limit=] [cursor=]\n  block     get|update|delete <block_id> [type={..}] [archived=] | list children <block_id> | append block <block_id> children='[block objects]' [after=<block_id>]\n  comment   list <block_or_page_id> | create parent={\"page_id\":..} text='[{\"text\":{\"content\":..}}]'\n  data source  get|query|update <data_source_id> [filter={..}] [sorts='[{\"property\":..,\"direction\":\"ascending|descending\"}]'] [title='[..]'] [properties={..}] | create parent={\"page_id\":..} properties={..} [title='[..]'] | list templates <data_source_id>\n  database  get <database_id> (lists its data sources)\n  user      get <user_id> | list | get self (bot)\n  search    [query] [filter={\"property\":\"object\",\"value\":\"page|data_source\"}] [sort={\"direction\":\"descending\",\"timestamp\":\"last_edited_time\"}]\nPaging keys: limit=N cursor=<next_cursor>\nExamples: search \"Meeting notes\" limit=5\n  query data source 59833787-2cf9-4fdf-8782-e53db20768a5 filter={\"property\":\"Status\",\"select\":{\"equals\":\"Done\"}}\n  append block 59833787-2cf9-4fdf-8782-e53db20768a5 children='[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"paragraph\":{\"rich_text\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":{\"content\":\"Hi\"}}]}}]'",
